  "content": "# 第34题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n34. Which would be the best title for the passage?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Is Johnson More Competent Than Taylor?\n\nB. B. Is Quantum Computing Redefining Technology?\n\nC. C. Will Quantum Computers Ever Come into Being?\n\nD. D. Will Quantum Computing Ever Live Up to Its Hype?\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查时态。由at this time yesterday可知用过去进行时，表示过去某一时刻正在进行的动作。故选A。"
